TMT implements adapters for the pinned sources recorded in dependencies.lock.
The Fortran public modules and selected pure Python State, solver-parameter,
constants, v54, and vTS1 modules are adapted from NCAR/MUSICA. Their original
copyright and Apache-2.0 notices are retained. TMT does not compile the MUSICA
native implementation.

Fable sources and its Python generator are extracted unchanged from the
TurboMICM tier3/fable/max revision recorded in dependencies.lock. TurboTUV,
including its bundled libyaml parser and datasets, is also extracted unchanged.
The TurboTUV installation includes its license and the libyaml license.

The compatibility investigation also inspected NCAR/MechanismConfiguration
revision fa34180f5c501bf654f089b9a14305876a86eefa, pinned by the selected MUSICA
revision. This reference is not a build dependency. No code from that native
implementation is compiled or installed by TMT.
